    "%@ has started! Beat levels to win amazing rewards!" : {
      "comment" : "T1 NEW: events.md §6.4 local notification eventStart (%@ = event name; 10:00-21:00 local, max 1 event notification per 24 h). TR DRAFT (T1) -> T2 review",
