          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本游戏按现状提供。我们可能会更新游戏及本条款。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game works offline. Purchases are processed by Apple. Our purchase service, RevenueCat, receives an anonymous ID and your purchase records." : {
      "comment" : "T1: was 'The game works offline. Purchases are handled by Apple.' (release-plan §2.5 S-7). Privacy page ¶3 (S-7 wording). 'works offline' stays true for play; never claim 'no network' (memory no-network-claim-is-false). TR DRAFT (T1) -> T2 review",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Spiel funktioniert offline. Käufe wickelt Apple ab. Unser Kaufdienst RevenueCat erhält eine anonyme ID und deinen Kaufverlauf."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The game works offline. Purchases are processed by Apple. Our purchase service, RevenueCat, receives an anonymous ID and your purchase records."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El juego funciona sin conexión. Apple procesa las compras. Nuestro servicio de compras, RevenueCat, recibe un ID anónimo y tu historial de compras."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le jeu fonctionne hors ligne. Les achats sont traités par Apple. Notre service d'achats, RevenueCat, reçoit un identifiant anonyme et l'historique de tes achats."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il gioco funziona offline. Gli acquisti sono elaborati da Apple. Il nostro servizio acquisti, RevenueCat, riceve un ID anonimo e lo storico dei tuoi acquisti."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ゲームはオフラインで動作します。購入はAppleが処理します。購入管理サービスのRevenueCatは、匿名IDと購入履歴を受け取ります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "게임은 오프라인으로 작동합니다. 구매는 Apple이 처리합니다. 당사의 구매 서비스인 RevenueCat은 익명 ID와 구매 기록을 받습니다."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gra działa offline. Zakupy przetwarza Apple. Nasza usługa zakupów, RevenueCat, otrzymuje anonimowy identyfikator i historię twoich zakupów."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O jogo funciona offline. As compras são processadas pela Apple. Nosso serviço de compras, RevenueCat, recebe um ID anônimo e seu histórico de compras."
          }
        },
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hra funguje offline. Nákupy spracúva Apple. Naša nákupná služba RevenueCat dostáva anonymný identifikátor a históriu tvojich nákupov."
          }
        },
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Igra deluje brez povezave. Nakupe obdela Apple. Naša storitev za nakupe, RevenueCat, prejme anonimni ID in zgodovino tvojih nakupov."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oyun çevrimdışı çalışır. Satın almalar Apple tarafından işlenir. Satın alma hizmetimiz RevenueCat, anonim bir kimlik ve satın alma kayıtlarını alır."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏可离线运行。购买由Apple处理。我们的购买服务RevenueCat会收到一个匿名ID和你的购买记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The hourglass freezes the timer for 10 seconds. The bulb shows an arrow that can move." : {
      "comment" : "SHELL request: SHELL S1: Support page body (SPEC-ui §2.13.1; SPEC-gameplay boosters.freezeSeconds 10)",
