    "Your progress and coins are saved only on this device. Deleting the game erases them." : {
      "comment" : "T1: was 'Your progress is saved on this device.' (PLAN-P OD10 default ('accept the loss in 1.0, one line on the support page'); revert to the old key if the owner picks iCloud backup; shell request row). Support page body under 'Your progress' (SPEC-ui §2.13.1). Consumables cannot be restored (release-plan §3.4). TR DRAFT (T1) -> T2 review",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Fortschritt und deine Münzen werden nur auf diesem Gerät gespeichert. Wenn du das Spiel löschst, gehen sie verloren."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your progress and coins are saved only on this device. Deleting the game erases them."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu progreso y tus monedas se guardan solo en este dispositivo. Si borras el juego, se pierden."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ta progression et tes pièces sont enregistrées uniquement sur cet appareil. Supprimer le jeu les efface."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I tuoi progressi e le tue monete sono salvati solo su questo dispositivo. Se elimini il gioco, andranno persi."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "進行状況とコインはこのデバイスにのみ保存されます。ゲームを削除すると消えてしまいます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "진행 상황과 코인은 이 기기에만 저장돼요. 게임을 삭제하면 사라져요."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Twój postęp i monety są zapisywane tylko na tym urządzeniu. Usunięcie gry je wymaże."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seu progresso e suas moedas ficam salvos somente neste dispositivo. Se você apagar o jogo, eles serão perdidos."
          }
        },
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tvoj postup a mince sa ukladajú iba v tomto zariadení. Odstránením hry sa vymažú."
          }
        },
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tvoj napredek in kovanci so shranjeni samo v tej napravi. Če izbrišeš igro, se izbrišejo."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "İlerlemen ve altınların yalnızca bu cihazda saklanır. Oyunu silersen bunlar da silinir."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的进度和金币仅保存在此设备上。删除游戏会清除这些数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
